  "id": "group-problem-solving",
  "term": "group problem solving",
  "definition": "Group problem solving is the process of a small group working together on complex cognitive tasks to reach solutions or complete shared assignments. In this context, it is used as a way to evaluate how well a group performs collectively and how that performance relates to broader collective intelligence.",
